{'symbol': 'USB', 'date': '2022-12-21 19:15:00', 'title': 'U.S. BANCORP SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT PENDING: CONTACT LEVI & KORSINSKY BEFORE DECEMBER 27, 2022 TO DISCUSS YOUR RIGHTS - USB', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - DECEMBER 21, 2022) - LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN U.S. BANCORP ("U.S. BANCORP" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: USB) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT.THE LAWSUIT ON BEHALF OF U.S. BANCORP INVESTORS HAS BEEN COMMENCED IN THE THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE SOUTHERN DISTRICT OF NEW YORK. AFFECTED INVESTORS PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED CERTAIN U.S. BANCORP SECURITIES BETWEEN AUGUST 1, 2019 AND JULY 28, 2022.'}{'symbol': 'USB', 'date': '2022-12-21 08:29:00', 'title': 'MONDAY DEADLINE REMINDER: THE SCHALL LAW FIRM FILES CLASS ACTION ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS IN U.S. BANCORP AND ADVISES SHAREHOLDERS WITH LOSSES OF $100,000 TO CONTACT THE FIRM', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES, CALIFORNIA--(NEWSFILE CORP. - DECEMBER 21, 2022) - THE SCHALL LAW FIRM, A NATIONAL SHAREHOLDER RIGHTS LITIGATION FIRM, REMINDS INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST U.S. BANCORP ("U.S. BANK" OR "THE COMPANY") (NYSE: USB) FOR VIOLATIONS OF §§10(B) AND 20(A) OF THE SECURITIES EXCHANGE ACT OF 1934 AND RULE 10B-5 PROMULGATED THEREUNDER BY THE U.S. SECURITIES AND EXCHANGE COMMISSION.'}{'symbol': 'USB', 'date': '2022-12-21 05:45:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: THE GROSS LAW FIRM NOTIFIES SHAREHOLDERS OF U.S. BANCORP OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF DECEMBER 27, 2022 - (NYSE: USB)', 'text': 'NEW YORK , DEC. 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE GROSS LAW FIRM ISSUES THE FOLLOWING NOTICE TO SHAREHOLDERS OF U.S. BANCORP. SHAREHOLDERS WHO PURCHASED SHARES OF USB DURING THE CLASS PERIOD LISTED ARE ENCOURAGED TO CONTACT THE FIRM REGARDING POSSIBLE LEAD PLAINTIFF APPOINTMENT.'}